Package: udev
Version: 032-r4
Description:  udev is a program which dynamically creates and removes device nodes from /dev/. It responds to /sbin/hotplug device events and requires a 2.6 kernel.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/kernel/hotplug/udev-032.tar.gz 	   file://flags.patch;patch=1 	   file://tmpfs.patch;patch=1 	   file://noasmlinkage.patch;patch=1 	   file://busybox.patch;patch=1
Depends: udev, libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726)
